fixture tech02_control_all_resources
doc Control for tech 2: everything but the dash-jump (a full-speed run, a full jump at the last coyote frame, the air jump and the air dash, at the best timing a search over them found) falls into the chasm the dash-jump clears
room test/chasm
spawn 100 384
frames 160
input
  0..49 R
  50..81 R jump
  82 R
  83..109 R jump
  110 R jump dash
  111..122 R jump
  123..159 R
end
expect
  at 50 event.jump=1 vx=2304
  at 82 event.air_jump=0
  at 83 event.air_jump=1
  at 110 event.dash=1
  # Short of the far ledge: below its lip (with the ledge-grab's 10 u to spare) before reaching
  # its face, and never standing on it.
  mark below 60..159 y>394u
  at below x<2144u
  never 0..159 x>=2144u ground=1
end
